        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `answer_with_context.py` that calls a hosted LLM to answer a question using provided context, I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which is a concrete external provider. I will import the necessary modules from the Amazon Bedrock SDK and use the `bedrock-client` to make the API call. This will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
