        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `extract_json.py` that calls a hosted LLM to extract structured JSON from text, I need to select a concrete external provider. I will use Amazon Bedrock, which provides access to various foundation models, including those capable of extracting structured data. The code will import the necessary Bedrock client and make a call to the appropriate model to extract JSON from the provided text. </thinking>\n",
